{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026JiqOILYJQL1793285914.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國第三季經濟增長見一年以來最高。</p><p></p><p>美國商務部公布，第三季國內生產總值，按年率計增長百分之3.4，較第二季高1個百分點，並且升幅高過市場預測的百分之3.2。</p><p></p><p>至於聯儲局用作衡量通脹指標的核心PCE物價指數，第三季升幅放慢至百分之2.5，但稍高過市場預測的百分之2.4。 </p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T15:41:52.358729+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T14:57:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:20:20.122806+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T15:38:30.508894+00:00","content_hash":"78685c88cccee147877cd79acbad90cf6d5eef7e47ad5cc1896df2ff31543cca","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T15:41:52.358729+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}